  "description": "LORWOH crystallizes in the rhombohedral crystal system with space group R -3. Reported CIF formula moiety: C62 H82 N6 Nd4 O24,4(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Nd1 (Nd) has 7 O neighbors; Nd2 (Nd) has 8 O neighbors; Nd1I (Nd) has 7 O neighbors; Nd2I (Nd) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 3 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a chain with approximately linear metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.950-4.015 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 108.33-110.80°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C66H98N6Nd4O28.",
